[{"answer":"Hello, Jane Fairbanks speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Frank Pritchard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just retired and moved to Southoe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to become a volunteer,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and I gather you co-ordinate voluntary work in the village.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of thing could I do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we need help with the village library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"We borrow books from the town library,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and individuals also donate them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"So, one thing you could do is get involved in collecting them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"if you've got a car, that is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The times are pretty flexible so we can arrange it to suit you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, another thing is the records that we keep of the books we're given,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and those we borrow and need to return to the town library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be very useful to have another person to help keep them up to date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm used to working on a computer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume they're computerised?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Is the library purpose-built?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't noticed it when I've walked round the village.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"No, we simply have the use of a room in the village hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"the West Room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on the left as you go in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I must go and have a look inside the hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's a nice building.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you run a lunch club in the village for elderly people?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I know a lot of places do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we have a very successful club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I could help with transport, if that's of any use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh definitely!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"People come to the club from neighbouring villages,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and we're always in need of more drivers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"And does the club have groups that focus on a particular hobby, too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I could get involved in one or two,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"particularly if there are any art groups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll find out where we need help and get back to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"What about help for individual residents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you arrange that at all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do it as a one-off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, there's Mrs Carroll.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"She needs a lift to the hospital next week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and we're struggling to find someone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"When's her appointment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"On Tuesday. It would take the whole morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I could do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that would be great. Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And also, next week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"we're arranging to have some work done to Mr Selsbury's house before he moves,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"as he isn't healthy enough to do it himself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got some people to decorate his kitchen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but if you could do some weeding in his garden,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"that would be wonderful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. I'd enjoy that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And presumably the day and time are flexible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. Just say when would suit you best, and we'll let Mr Selsbury know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"The volunteers group also organises monthly social events,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"which is a great way to meet other people, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"So next month, on the 19th of October,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"we're holding a quiz,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"a couple of residents are great at planning unusual ones,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and we always fill the village hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/68.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds like fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I do anything to help?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, because of the number of people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/71.mp3"},{"answer":"we need plenty of refreshments for halfway through.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/72.mp3"},{"answer":"So, if you could provide any, we'd be grateful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure I could.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll think about what to make, and let you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Then on November the 18th,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/77.mp3"},{"answer":"we're holding a dance, also in the village hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/78.mp3"},{"answer":"We've booked a band that specialises in music of the 1930s,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/79.mp3"},{"answer":"they've been before, and we've had a lot of requests to bring them back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not really a dancer, but I'd like to do something to help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we sell tickets in advance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/82.mp3"},{"answer":"and having an extra person to check them at the door, as people arrive, would be good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/83.mp3"},{"answer":"it can be quite a bottleneck if everyone arrives at once!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/84.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I'm happy with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, we're also arranging a New Year's Eve party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/86.mp3"},{"answer":"We're expecting that to be a really big event,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/87.mp3"},{"answer":"so instead of the village hall, it'll be held in the Mountfort Hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/88.mp3"},{"answer":"The...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Mountfort.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Mountfort Hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/91.mp3"},{"answer":"It isn't in Southoe itself, but it's only a couple of miles away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/92.mp3"},{"answer":"The hotel will be providing dinner and we've booked a band.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/93.mp3"},{"answer":"The one thing we haven't got yet is a poster.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/94.mp3"},{"answer":"That isn't something you could do, by any chance, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Well actually, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/96.mp3"},{"answer":"Before I retired I was a graphic designer, so that's right up my street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh perfect!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/98.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll give you the details,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/99.mp3"},{"answer":"and then perhaps you could send me a draft...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/100.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-1-2022-12-22-23-05-46/101.mp3"}]
